    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p><p>Tangent at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;the ellipse is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>This&nbsp;intersect&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sec</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Drawing the figure as per the information, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/766c615e-823c-4732-890a-1d2a1204755d-image.png\" style=\"width: 380px; height: 256px;\" /></p><p>Area of triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sec</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p><p>I.&nbsp; If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi>Q</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>II. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi>T</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>III.&nbsp; If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>IV.&nbsp; If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
